(7042231, 1069839, 28427, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an entry of a few challenges ago, called "Circus" by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=49109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">h2</a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1062889" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1733/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1062889.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1733/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1062889.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1733/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1062889.jpg"/></a>:)<br/>No matter how I try, I just can''t find glass balls like these.<br/>A plain simple maximum of score because I just adore the crispiness, the vibrant colours, the refraction, and of course, the glass balls themselves.</td>', 'Reminds me of an entry of a few challenges ago, called "Circus" by  h2 :)No matter how I try, I just can''t find glass balls like these.A plain simple maximum of score because I just adore the crispiness, the vibrant colours, the refraction, and of course, the glass balls themselves.', '2013-05-23 15:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042248, 1069839, 91360, '<td valign="top">hipnotic :)</td>', 'hipnotic :)', '2013-05-23 16:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042259, 1069990, 28427, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  The water looks as you''ve unleashed a selective desaturation on it, while this did not the case.  The tension of the water surface underneath the leaf, the ripples of the streaming water, the light reflection: all comes perfectly together.</td>', 'Very beautiful.  The water looks as you''ve unleashed a selective desaturation on it, while this did not the case.  The tension of the water surface underneath the leaf, the ripples of the streaming water, the light reflection: all comes perfectly together.', '2013-05-23 16:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042260, 1069953, 28427, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp reflection</td>', 'Nice sharp reflection', '2013-05-23 16:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042261, 1069616, 28427, '<td valign="top">Beautiful refreshing colours</td>', 'Beautiful refreshing colours', '2013-05-23 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042357, 1069953, 161988, '<td valign="top">The reflection and lighting is beautifully done.  However, the real genius here lies in the depth of the story your photo tell''s and the brilliance to put such a thought into motion.  Exceptionally well done!</td>', 'The reflection and lighting is beautifully done.  However, the real genius here lies in the depth of the story your photo tell''s and the brilliance to put such a thought into motion.  Exceptionally well done!', '2013-05-23 22:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042358, 1069795, 161988, '<td valign="top">If you photoshopped this photograph to create the end result then I''m impressed by your imagination and ability to bring your thoughts to fruition.  If you actually captured a shot of this frog in it''s natural environment then National Georgraphic Magazine needs to get you on their payroll - fast!</td>', 'If you photoshopped this photograph to create the end result then I''m impressed by your imagination and ability to bring your thoughts to fruition.  If you actually captured a shot of this frog in it''s natural environment then National Georgraphic Magazine needs to get you on their payroll - fast!', '2013-05-23 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
