(7042467, 1070019, 115814, '<td valign="top">One of my top two for this challenge. The color is so subdued, subtle even (oops that''s this week). I can''t decide if the small bead is distracting or an essential element, but I don''t really care either way, this draws me in. Nice. 9</td>', 'One of my top two for this challenge. The color is so subdued, subtle even (oops that''s this week). I can''t decide if the small bead is distracting or an essential element, but I don''t really care either way, this draws me in. Nice. 9', '2013-05-23 23:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
