(7043887, 1069927, 113900, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot Mike.  I was going to enter a similar shot about a month ago for the Meme challenge but I looked at the file and realized my Go-Pro was not set to the right date.   Oops<br/> <br/>Snorkeling with Turtles is probably my favoritr thing in the world.   My family and I went to Kauai for 2 weeks and we went snorkling almost every day.    There is a place called Anini beach where you can find turtles without fail.   At one point I was swimming with seven turtles in one 20 yard area.   <br/> <br/>Anyway, great shot.   I love the patterns and colors of their shells.</td>', 'Awesome shot Mike.  I was going to enter a similar shot about a month ago for the Meme challenge but I looked at the file and realized my Go-Pro was not set to the right date.   Oops Snorkeling with Turtles is probably my favoritr thing in the world.   My family and I went to Kauai for 2 weeks and we went snorkling almost every day.    There is a place called Anini beach where you can find turtles without fail.   At one point I was swimming with seven turtles in one 20 yard area.    Anyway, great shot.   I love the patterns and colors of their shells.', '2013-05-27 14:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
