(7150741, 1069982, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s no way this is worth a 4.8. I''m not sure why this image scored so poorly. It certainly conveys green to me. It''s a beautiful boat and pond/lake with beautiful foliage all around. I''d love to hop in that boat and pedal around. <br/> <br/>Again, I don''t know why it scored so poorly. It''s well composed, in focus, nice colors, nice lighting... Maybe they didn''t like the bush? It does feel a little voyeuristic like in those cheesy Summer camp type movies. I wonder if maybe it''s just the style in which people vote. There was a lot of good shots in front of you, so maybe people voted with a ranking system?</td>', 'There''s no way this is worth a 4.8. I''m not sure why this image scored so poorly. It certainly conveys green to me. It''s a beautiful boat and pond/lake with beautiful foliage all around. I''d love to hop in that boat and pedal around.  Again, I don''t know why it scored so poorly. It''s well composed, in focus, nice colors, nice lighting... Maybe they didn''t like the bush? It does feel a little voyeuristic like in those cheesy Summer camp type movies. I wonder if maybe it''s just the style in which people vote. There was a lot of good shots in front of you, so maybe people voted with a ranking system?', '2014-01-02 13:01:27.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
